{"id": null, "n": "0942001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0942001", "type": "mod", "text": "稽【大】，啟【考偽-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0942002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0942002", "type": "mod", "text": "悲【大】，盡【考偽-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0942003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0942003", "type": "mod", "text": "起【大】，犯【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0942004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0942004", "type": "mod", "text": "合【大】，令【考偽-原】【考偽-甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0941010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0941010", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】縮刷大藏經，【甲】黃蘗版淨嚴等校訂加筆本塚本賢曉氏藏"}
{"id": null, "n": "0942001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0942001", "type": "orig", "text": "稽＝啟ヵ【原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0942002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0942002", "type": "orig", "text": "悲＝盡ヵ【原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0942003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0942003", "type": "orig", "text": "起＝犯【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0942004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0942004", "type": "orig", "text": "合＝令ヵ【原】【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0942005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0942005", "type": "orig", "text": "甲本奧書曰元祿十五年十二月二十九日以和上御本再校了尊教寶永三丙戌之春得斯密軌戊子之春一校了苾芻性寂"}
